<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech CNB to cut Lombard rate to 23 pct (50 pct).</title>
<headline>Czech CNB to cut Lombard rate to 23 pct (50 pct).</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Czech National Bank (CNB) said on Thursday that it would cut its last resort Lombard lending facility to 23 percent from a previous rate of 50 percent.</p>
<p>The CNB added in a statement that the cut would take effect on June 27.</p>
</text>
